  "scientific_limits": [
    "Regulatory faja-marginal geometry describes protected/legal river or ravine margins and is not an observed event inundation footprint.",
    "The 17.2 km and Huallampi reaches do not constitute a complete Río Cañete basin or full river geometry.",
    "Jacayita is a named tributary ravine with official margin geometry, but it must not be generalized to San Jerónimo, Condoray, Picamarán or other tributaries.",
    "Current cleaning, desilting, dikes, enrockment and definitive designs are present-day mitigation context; they cannot be backcast as historical channel capacity.",
    "No source in this package provides event-paired primary rainfall and stage/discharge observations sufficient for a replay contract.",
    "No verified hydrologic negative control is created.",
    "No design discharge, project criterion or current intervention state is promoted into an IRFEN threshold."
